      'output': segment.totals.output,
      'cacheRead': segment.totals.cacheRead,
      'requests': segment.totals.requests,
      'source': segment.source.wire,
    })}';","oldText":"/// The pinned one-line shape (AC7): every field documented in gh-1241,
